    "reason_not_promoted": "The improved candidate path depends on manually controlled English translations. Automatic translation quality, latency, cost, and full-benchmark regression behavior have not been evaluated.",
    "main_finding": "For the six-question NE->EN slice, translated English contextual-dense plus BM25 retrieval with depth-100 components recovered all manually verified primary evidence within the final top-20 candidate pool. After reranking both variants with the original Nepali query, translated-hybrid BGE achieved 0.833 Hit@5 and 0.833 Recall@5 versus production BGE at 0.667 and 0.722. At @10 and @20, translated-hybrid BGE achieved 1.000 hit rate and 1.000 recall.",
